Package: draftside-companion
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Draftside Contributors <maintainers@draftside.dev>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-websocket, python3-keyring, python3-secretstorage
Recommends: google-chrome-stable | chromium-browser | chromium
Homepage: https://github.com/fdsouvenir/espn-fantasy-draft-bot
Description: Read-only ESPN fantasy draft laptop companion
 Draftside Companion observes the ESPN draft room already open in a dedicated
 local Chrome profile and delivers signed, normalized draft events to a private
 Draftside backend. It never submits picks or stores ESPN credentials.
